    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kano kahandiichilwa Tseofilo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tseofilo, eshitabu shilia shiambeli ndashikasia khumakhuwa ako kosi aka Yesu yachaaka okhukhola nende okhwechesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yasuubisia mbu Roho Omutakatifu aleetsa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuula khunyanga yeneyo olwa yakulusibwa, olwa yali namalile okhubalachilisia muRoho Omutakatifu abarume abo aba yali niyalobola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi nibo aba yeelolosilia nali omulamu olunyuma Iwobusaalilibwe khulwa ebilolelo ebinji, nabaloleshelanga khushise shietsindaalo amakhumi kane, nasungananga ninabo khumakhuwa kobwami bwaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolundi olwa yali nakhung'aaniile ninabo halala, yabakaania mbu baleshe okhwinyokha okhurula eYerusalemu tawe, ne mbu balindiilile obusuubisie bwaPapa, obwa mwahuliilekhwo khwisie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba toto mwene, Yohana yabatisinjia nende amatsi; ne inywe mwakhabatisibwe nende Roho Omutakatifu olunyuma lwetsindaalo tsinduutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhukulukha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa bali nibakhung'aaniile halala bamureeba bari Omwami, tsino nitsio tsindaalo olwa witsa okhukalusilia Isiraeli obwami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabakalusia mbu Shinakeenywe okhumanya ebise kata tsinduukho etsia Papa yareele mubunyali bubwe omwene ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mulanyoola amaani olwa Roho Omutakatifu alaba namwitsiile; ne mulaba abarumbusi banje muYerusalemu, nende mubuYahudi mwosi, nende eSamaria, kata okhuula khushihesi shieshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nasunjile amakhuwa ako, nabo nibahenganga, yakulusibwa; mana lileesi nilimuyila okhurula mumoni tsiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali niboomisiye tsimoni okhuhenga mwikulu nashitsia, lole, abasaatsa babili nibasinjila ahambi ninabo nibeefwalile ebiifwalo ebilafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabo nibasunga mbu Inywe abandu beGalilaya, olwashiina nimusinjiile nimuhenga mwikulu? Yesu uno owamurusiibwekhwo nakulusibwa nayilwa mwikulu aleetsa ario shinga olwa mumuluutsi natsia mwikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Owakalukha mushilenje shiaYudayalobolwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nibakalukha eYerusalemu okhurula khushikulu shiEmitseituni, eshili ahambi nende Yerusalemu, shinga oluchendo Iweinyanga yaSabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibeenjiile, baniina mushisika shiahekulu, ewa bali nibamenyanga; mbabano, mbu Petero naYohana naYakobo naAnderea, Filipo naTomasi, Baritsolomayo naMatsayo, Yakobo waAlufayo, naSimoni Zelote, nende Yuda waYakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bosi bali abomwoyo mulala, nibalumilila mukhusaaya, halala nende abakhasi balia, nende Mariamu nyinamwana Yesu, khandi nende abasiani babwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo tsienetsio Petero yasinjila hakari wabaana babwe; ne kwaliho omukanda kwabandu, bosi halala shinga eshikhumi namakhumi kabili; nasunga ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana beefwe, kali nikakhoyeele mbu lihandiiko elo liusibwe, elia Roho Omutakatifu yaboola khale mumunwa kwaDaudi khuYuda, owabeemilila injila abamuhamba Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba yabalilwa mwifwe, nakabilwa omukabokwe mubukhalabani buno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu oyo yakula eshianyi amatani kobumayaanubwe; nakwa mafumama, nanyalushila hakari, amalake kosi nikarula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako nikamanyishila abo bosi abamenyanga eYerusalemu, okhuula olwa eshianyi eshio shialangwa mululimi lwabwe mbu Akeladama, eshisina mbu Eshianyi Shiamatsayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila kahandiikwa mushitabu shieTsitsabuli, mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibalobola babili, mbu Yusufu oulangwa mbu Barisaba, owakulikhwa mbu Yusito, nende Matsiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibasaaya, nibasunga bari E Omwami, iwe oumanyile emioyo chiabandu bosi khubano babili okhumanyie omwenoyo owa oloboole, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu yeenjile mubwikhalo obwomubukhalabani nende oburume buno obwa Yuda yalekha mbu atsie ewuwe omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakhupa ikha khubo; nayo ikha niyimukwila Matsiya; naye nabalilwa halala nende abarume ekhumi namulala abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
